/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%81%9C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%E5%95%A6%EF%BC%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/49/iwph0dvl2om1rehhx13kkfqo2jyxx7n.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%81%9C%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%E5%95%A6%EF%BC%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/49/iwph0dvl2om1rehhx13kkfqo2jyxx7n.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />停不下来啦！\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"随便找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">随便找找</font></span></span>]变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]，可按照顺序获得并触发对应技能的效果，行动结束时重置触发顺序。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"随便找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">随便找找</font></span></span>]变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]，可按照顺序获得并触发对应技能的效果，行动结束时重置触发顺序。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：触发1次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">超级晶石技能</span>]的效果，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"随便找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">随便找找</font></span></span>]变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]，可按照顺序获得并触发对应技能的效果，行动结束时重置触发顺序。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：触发1次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">超级晶石技能</span>]的效果，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。<br />✦释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"认真找找\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">认真找找</font></span></span>]后，可触发自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内其他友军的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"决意之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/40px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/60px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/80px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\